/T (The FarmDB application connects the normalized database with end-user workflows. Built using a 3-tier modular architecture in Python/JavaScript, it provides unified data management for crop planning, input tracking, and farm finance. The system utilizes parameterized SQL statements to prevent SQL injection vulnerabilities and ensures atomic, transaction-aware persistence for multi-table updates.)
/E (The FarmDB application connects the normalized database with end-user workflows. Built using a 3-tier modular architecture in Python/JavaScript, it provides unified data management for crop planning, input tracking, and farm finance. The system utilizes parameterized SQL statements to prevent SQL injection vulnerabilities and ensures atomic, transaction-aware persistence for multi-table updates.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
